<title>ISRAEL: Israel, PLO begin talks.</title>
<headline>Israel, PLO begin talks.</headline>
<dateline>EREZ, Gaza Strip 1996-10-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel and the PLO resumed on Sunday U.S.-brokered talks, the result of a White House summit called to end a wave of Israeli-Palestinian violence, witnesses said.</p>
<p>Negotiators convened with U.S. peace envoy Dennis Ross at an liaison office at the Erez border crossing between Israel and the Gaza Strip after U.S. Secretary of State Warren Christopher met separately with Israeli Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu and Palestinian President Yasser Arafat.</p>
</text>
